00:13:31,210 --> 00:13:33,850
I'll pat your tummy for you.

269
00:13:33,850 --> 00:13:36,090
HEART FLUTTERING

270
00:13:38,110 --> 00:13:40,310
Pat my tummy?

271
00:13:40,310 --> 00:13:41,130
Eh?

272
00:13:41,510 --> 00:13:43,700
Ms. Akemi and Kuguri said

273
00:13:43,710 --> 00:13:47,510
if no one sleeps with you
and pats your tummy, 

274
00:13:47,510 --> 00:13:50,310
your cold won't get better, 
and you might even die.

275
00:13:50,310 --> 00:13:52,410
She got tricked again!

276
00:13:52,410 --> 00:13:56,460
Did I take a joke seriously again?

277
00:13:56,460 --> 00:13:58,400
Even if it were true, 

278
00:13:58,410 --> 00:14:01,670
it would be strange
for Senior Kuguri to know that.

279
00:14:01,660 --> 00:14:04,910
S-sorry, I messed up again.

280
00:14:04,910 --> 00:14:09,110
So I can just take care of you normally?

281
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:13,540
TOUCH

282
00:14:14,970 --> 00:14:18,660
That's good, 
you don't seem to have a fever.

283
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:20,110
I'm sorry.

284
00:14:20,110 --> 00:14:22,560
You were feeling unwell, 
and I didn't even notice.

285
00:14:22,560 --> 00:14:24,010
I'm such an unworthy teacher.

286
00:14:24,010 --> 00:14:25,910
No… Sensei.

287
00:14:26,470 --> 00:14:29,120
I lied about having a cold.

288
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:32,960
SHOCKED
Your cold was fake too?

289
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:34,670
SHOCKED
I feel so bad

290
00:14:34,660 --> 00:14:35,770
SHOCKED
seeing Sensei being fooled by us.

291
00:14:36,410 --> 00:14:38,710
Oh… I see.

292
00:14:38,710 --> 00:14:44,560
This way you could avoid the kiss.

293
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:46,860
You're really smart.

294
00:14:46,860 --> 00:14:48,300
N-not really.

295
00:14:48,310 --> 00:14:51,960
But the King Game ended just like that.

296
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:53,710
Is it really okay?

297
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:57,960
Th-then I'll head back to the room.

298
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,260
Good night.

299
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:00,770
Okay.

300
00:15:01,650 --> 00:15:04,400
Huh? The door won't open.

301
00:15:08,110 --> 00:15:09,760
It won't open at all.

302
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:11,160
Are we locked in?

303
00:15:13,250 --> 00:15:15,980
LOCKED ON BOTH SIDES, SUPPORT BAR
I won't let you off that easy.

304
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:21,060
Then I'll crank the AC over there
for a full 30 minutes.

305
00:15:21,810 --> 00:15:24,660
When two people are huddling for warmth
in the freezing cold, 

306
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:26,760
something's bound to happen.

307
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,370
Tomorrow morning, 

308
00:15:28,370 --> 00:15:32,010
I can snap pictures of them looking all shy
after crossing the line.

309
00:15:32,010 --> 00:15:33,520
It's the perfect plan.

310
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:36,750
Kaya, what are you doing?

311
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:38,160
Ms. Akemi.

312
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:40,760
I locked the two of them in.

313
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:41,760
Geez.

314
00:15:41,750 --> 00:15:42,900
I appreciate it, 

315
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:45,570
but we have plans tomorrow.
Don't stay up late, okay?

316
00:15:48,110 --> 00:15:51,370
Here, let me tuck you in.

317
00:15:51,370 --> 00:15:52,660
Wait!

318
00:15:58,160 --> 00:16:00,560
What's going on here?

319
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,860
Um…

320
00:16:01,860 --> 00:16:04,360
I don't mind catching a little breeze.

321
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,110
Don't do that.

322
00:16:06,110 --> 00:16:08,360
You'll definitely catch a cold.

323
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:10,010
I should get outside.

324
00:16:13,460 --> 00:16:15,460
What kind of sneeze is that?

325
00:16:15,470 --> 00:16:18,410
Yowayowa-sensei's cold resistance
is weak too.

326
00:16:18,410 --> 00:16:21,560
Sorry, maybe we should share it?

327
00:16:22,970 --> 00:16:24,720
It's really a problem.

328
00:16:24,710 --> 00:16:28,310
This is an old lodge, 
so we can't be too loud.

329
00:16:28,310 --> 00:16:30,810
Is the AC broken?

330
00:16:30,810 --> 00:16:34,620
Senior Kuguri must be behind this.

331
00:16:35,110 --> 00:16:38,310
But Sensei huddles up to me so naturally.

332
00:16:38,310 --> 00:16:42,360
She really doesn't see me
as a man, does she?

333
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:45,200
Even though
I feel we've gotten pretty close, 

334
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:47,610
am I still just a kid in her eyes?

335
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,860
Um…

336
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:53,760
If we had kissed back then, 

337
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:55,580
I wonder what would have happened.

338
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:59,410
What am I saying?

339
00:16:59,410 --> 00:17:02,720
No, a simple question
shouldn't hurt, right?

340
00:17:05,890 --> 00:17:07,890
SMOOCH

341
00:17:12,210 --> 00:17:16,960
T-That counts as a kiss, right?

342
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:22,099
Now we followed the King Game rules.

343
00:17:22,109 --> 00:17:24,510
I've been bothered by it this whole time.

344
00:17:24,510 --> 00:17:27,970
BEAMING
You've been hung up on it too, haven't you?

345
00:17:27,970 --> 00:17:31,660
BEAMING
Don't worry, now we've completed the order.

346
00:17:32,910 --> 00:17:33,610
LEANS
Now that I'm relaxed, 

347
00:17:33,610 --> 00:17:36,210
I get sleepy.

348
00:17:36,210 --> 00:17:37,810
Wait, Sensei?

349
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:44,360
Wh-what should I do now?

350
00:17:49,510 --> 00:17:52,860
Oh right, I fell asleep
like that yesterday.

351
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,570
Morning, you two.

352
00:18:01,570 --> 00:18:04,460
You had a steamy night, I bet…

353
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:05,820
Looks like it went well.

354
00:18:09,410 --> 00:18:10,720
It's a misunderstanding!

355
00:18:14,310 --> 00:18:18,860
King Kuguri, we kissed properly!

356
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:20,150
Sensei!

357
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:21,520
As the misunderstanding deepens, 

358
00:18:21,510 --> 00:18:23,590
there's no way to clear my name now.

359
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:26,590
DAY 2 OF TRAINING CAMP

360
00:18:28,760 --> 00:18:31,010
D-does it look okay?

361
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:34,460
Hiyo… are you an angel?

362
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:35,910
Sensei looks great in a swimsuit too, 

363
00:18:35,910 --> 00:18:38,210
but white clothes really suit you.

364
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,460
I happened to see this dress

365
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:44,070
and thought it would look perfect on you, 
so I bought it.

366
00:18:44,070 --> 00:18:45,460
Seems I got it right.

367
00:18:45,460 --> 00:18:47,750
Ms. Akemi, you have great taste.

368
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:50,250
White dresses are a must for summer.

369
00:18:50,260 --> 00:18:52,870
Sensei really is beautiful.

370
00:18:53,260 --> 00:18:56,460
How does it feel to finally cross the line, 
Abikura-kun?

371
00:18:56,460 --> 00:18:58,410
I didn't cross anything!

372
00:18:58,410 --> 00:19:01,560
By the way, Senior, 
that was your doing, wasn't it?

373
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:05,210
Abikura, you pervert.

374
00:19:05,210 --> 00:19:07,470
As your childhood friend, 
I'm ashamed of you.

375
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:12,270
Day two of Training Camp is free time.

376
00:19:12,270 --> 00:19:17,510
Everyone, separate here
and search for the best summer.

377
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:18,910
Let's go, Yuki.

378
00:19:18,910 --> 00:19:22,010
There are cats over there.
Come take pictures with me.

379
00:19:22,010 --> 00:19:25,720
Mukubayashi, 
there's an outfit I want you to try.

380
00:19:26,470 --> 00:19:28,110
They're all gone now.

381
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:30,860
They just met, 
but they're already so close.

382
00:19:30,860 --> 00:19:32,710
I'm so happy.

383
00:19:33,810 --> 00:19:35,410
We're finally alone.

384
00:19:35,410 --> 00:19:36,820
I need to say something.

385
00:19:37,210 --> 00:19:39,510
Asking her to hang out
should be fine, right?

386
00:19:43,310 --> 00:19:44,610
Did you get the shot?

387
00:19:45,460 --> 00:19:47,310
Y-yeah.

388
00:19:48,270 --> 00:19:50,020
You took it really well.

389
00:19:50,010 --> 00:19:52,410
It's not blurry at all. Amazing.

390
00:19:52,410 --> 00:19:54,360
Is this really praise?

391
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:59,660
Timing the shot
makes my arms ache every time, 

392
00:19:59,660 --> 00:20:02,310
so every photo I take ends up blurry.

393
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:04,710
Her stamina is so bad that
even image stabilization can't save it.

394
00:20:05,660 --> 00:20:08,660
I tried taking it with my phone, 

395
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:10,860
but this one's blurry too.

396
00:20:10,860 --> 00:20:12,410
This one too.

397
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:15,760
This is…

398
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:19,510
I accidentally took it in the bathhouse's
changing room yesterday.

399
00:20:19,510 --> 00:20:22,450
Why is this the only one
that isn't blurry?

400
00:20:24,510 --> 00:20:25,810
Abikura-kun, 

401
00:20:25,810 --> 00:20:28,510
can you walk with me today?

402
00:20:29,260 --> 00:20:31,250
Sensei invited me.

403
00:20:31,250 --> 00:20:33,150
O-of course.

404
00:20:34,260 --> 00:20:35,920
Great.

405
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:37,000
SAWARA MUNICIPAL ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

406
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,900
There's an elementary school.

407
00:20:38,910 --> 00:20:40,010
Yeah.

408
00:20:41,510 --> 00:20:43,960
PEEKING
They shouldn't be in class

409
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:45,060
right now…

410
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:47,420
I really want to take a look inside.

411
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:49,420
Sensei… we'll look suspicious.

412
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:53,310
By the way, you and Mukubayashi

413
00:20:53,310 --> 00:20:56,460
are childhood friends
from elementary school, right?

414
00:20:56,460 --> 00:20:58,420
Are you two close?

415
00:21:00,010 --> 00:21:03,110
We used to play together quite often.

416
00:21:03,110 --> 00:21:05,900
She's really kind.

417
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:09,410
She's nice to people, 
and also cherishes plants.

418
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:13,950
But she seems a bit cold only towards you.

419
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:16,170
I think she hates me now.

420
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,600
Is that so?

421
00:21:18,450 --> 00:21:25,460
I think she actually really
wants to get along with you.

422
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:27,700
TURN RIGHT IN 50 METERS AHEAD
What is it?

423
00:21:27,710 --> 00:21:28,810
SASAHARA FISHING TACKLE SHOP
Great!

424
00:21:28,810 --> 00:21:31,210
SASAHARA FISHING TACKLE SHOP
This sign is so interesting!

425
00:21:31,210 --> 00:21:32,210
Is it?

426
00:21:32,710 --> 00:21:35,610
This is a Spanish mackerel, right?

427
00:21:35,610 --> 00:21:37,010
Why does she know?

428
00:21:37,010 --> 00:21:39,060
This is a perfect photo spot.

429
00:21:39,060 --> 00:21:39,530
Can you

430
00:21:39,530 --> 00:21:40,820
CLICK
take a picture for me, Abikura-kun?

431
00:21:41,460 --> 00:21:44,320
She really likes fish.

432
00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:46,610
O-okay, I'll take it now.

433
00:21:47,420 --> 00:21:50,170
FLOATING

434
00:21:56,010 --> 00:21:57,760
That must be

435
00:21:57,770 --> 00:21:59,410
Sensei's underwear for weekend.

436
00:21:59,410 --> 00:22:00,670
No!

437
00:22:00,670 --> 00:22:03,510
Ms. Akemi brought it
with the dress this morning.

438
00:22:03,510 --> 00:22:06,360
She said I had to wear this.

439
00:22:06,360 --> 00:22:09,210
My sister finally went after
Sensei's underwear?

440
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:13,300
But this underwear keeps digging in…
it's really hard to walk.

441
00:22:14,910 --> 00:22:18,320
White really suits Sensei.

442
00:22:18,860 --> 00:22:21,360
Mukubayashi isn't back yet?

443
00:22:22,370 --> 00:22:23,610
Right.

444
00:22:23,610 --> 00:22:26,610
And her phone was dropped on the road.

445
00:22:26,610 --> 00:22:30,210
I remember telling her
we were meeting at 5 p.m.

446
00:22:30,210 --> 00:22:32,810
D-did she get kidnapped?

447
00:22:32,810 --> 00:22:34,670
W-we have to call the police!

448
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:36,660
Who can kidnap that monster?

449
00:22:36,660 --> 00:22:40,400
No, she's not the type to get kidnapped.

450
00:22:40,410 --> 00:22:42,710
We should be able to find her
if we look around.

451
00:22:42,710 --> 00:22:44,810
R-really?

452
00:22:44,810 --> 00:22:46,070
Can we really find her?

453
00:22:46,070 --> 00:22:47,370
With her walking stamina, 

454
00:22:47,370 --> 00:22:52,610
she might've walked all the way
to the next prefecture.

455
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:56,060
That can't be possible, right?

456
00:22:56,060 --> 00:22:58,220
I-I'll go look around too.

457
00:23:00,260 --> 00:23:02,660
She should be around here.

458
00:23:07,370 --> 00:23:08,170
There she is.

459
00:23:08,170 --> 00:23:10,170
A… Abikura?

460
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,360
BAWLING

461
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:15,350
Thank goodness, I finally made it back.

462
00:23:15,350 --> 00:23:17,950
Did she just fight a bear?

463
00:23:18,710 --> 00:23:20,410
Anyway, let's head back first.

464
00:23:20,410 --> 00:23:22,110
Everyone's worried about you.

465
00:23:22,610 --> 00:23:24,720
Did you come looking for me?

466
00:23:30,310 --> 00:23:34,150
I've been thinking
if I like you, Abikura.
